& [Fold01_IdentityBoundary] asks what every identity names
  + formation identity names prospective governance, not a runtime
  + scanner profile 0.1 names observation policy, not receipt representation or executable availability
  + forms and receipt profiles name current machine representation
  + acquisition identity names one future actual producer event
  + first and second name causally proven roles over distinct acquisition identities
  + carrier identity names complete derivation ancestry, not physical acquisition by itself
  + reconciliation identity names a pure comparison operation and result
  + evidence-grade identity names a supported claim class, not its support or issuer
  + receipt identity names a claim envelope, not present world state
  + prior and replacement formation signatures name distinct authority generations
  + [edge_one_acquisition_two_roles] rejects because role assignment cannot change event identity
  + [edge_same_digest_different_events] may remain possible only when both independent acquisition lineages exist
  + [finding] no identifier performs two semantic jobs

& [Fold02_LinguisticTruth] asks what public clauses honestly imply
  + actual means physically performed under later producer authority
  + complete means closure under the full declared acquisition contract
  + repeated means two distinct actual events
  + first-then-second means causal order rather than list position
  + common scope means every declared coordinate is equal
  + Equal means committed canonical subjects match under current pure reconciliation
  + NonAtomic denies snapshot, transaction, lock, indivisible traversal, and continuous sameness
  + evidence means inspectable supported claim, not guaranteed world state
  + issued means an authority-bearing claim act and cannot describe caller construction
  + quiescent, stable, unchanged, immutable, current, and safe remain stronger reserved words
  + [edge_change_restore] remains compatible with selected evidence
  + [edge_change_after_second] remains compatible
  + [edge_external_writer] remains compatible
  + [finding] every selected term states the weakest support and preserves uncertainty

